# Automatic Evidence Finalization

- Do not leave successful check-run shards as the newest unmerged evidence.
- Merge bias shards with `python -m evidence.profile_bias_merge`; never copy or
  concatenate result JSON manually.
- Before reporting a run as finished, ensure `STRATEGY_STATUS.csv`,
  `evidence/PIPELINE_STATE.json`, the supporting status reports, and
  `strategy_status.html` were regenerated successfully.
- Preserve raw shard files as provenance. Stop on identity mismatches or
  conflicting terminal verdicts.
- Read pipeline-wide status only from `evidence/PIPELINE_STATE.json` after the
  final refresh.
